%% Compact teaching diagram for defense Slide 22. Detailed failure and database boundaries remain in chapter5-order-confirm-stock.mmd.
%%{init: {"theme": "base", "sequence": {"showSequenceNumbers": true, "actorMargin": 180, "messageMargin": 36, "mirrorActors": false}, "themeVariables": {"fontFamily": "Arial, sans-serif", "primaryColor": "#eef6ff", "primaryBorderColor": "#2563eb", "actorBkg": "#f0fdf4", "actorBorderColor": "#16a34a", "actorBorder": "#16a34a", "noteBkgColor": "#fff7ed", "noteBorderColor": "#ea580c", "lineColor": "#475569"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Staff as Staff<br/>POS
  participant BFF as BFF<br/>auth guards
  participant Order as Order<br/>orchestrator
  participant Catalog as Catalog<br/>stock owner
  participant Event as Outbox / Kafka / Kitchen

  Staff->>BFF: Confirm pending order
  BFF->>BFF: Verify JWT, tenant, permission
  BFF->>Order: Verified confirm command
  Order->>Order: Lock and validate order in tenant scope

  alt Order already PROCESSING
    Order-->>BFF: Return current state
    BFF-->>Staff: Confirmation already applied
  else Order is PENDING and bill is OPEN
    Order->>Catalog: Deduct stock<br/>key + immutable payload
    Catalog->>Catalog: Transaction: lock reservation and stock rows
    alt New or previously released reservation
      Catalog->>Catalog: Deduct stock + persist RESERVED version
      Catalog-->>Order: APPLIED + reservationVersion
    else Active reservation with the same key and payload
      Catalog->>Catalog: Read stored result, no stock mutation
      Catalog-->>Order: REPLAYED + reservationVersion
    end
    Order->>Order: Transaction: PROCESSING + version + outbox
    Order-->>BFF: Confirmation success
    BFF-->>Staff: Confirmation success
    Order-->>Event: Relay committed order.confirmed
    Event->>Event: Kitchen creates KDS ticket
  end

  Note over Order,Catalog: Lost response: retry the same key and payload to receive REPLAYED<br/>Order commit failure after APPLIED: compensate the matching reservationVersion (Slide 23)
